on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [  5] extcall 44 .............................. <soundBusy(2)>
  [  8] jmpifz [ 19] ............................ if soundBusy(2) then
  [ 11] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 13] thebuiltin 21 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 15] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 17] extcall 22 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 19] ret
end
